上一提交给 Table 加了 onActivate，但强类型工厂 Table.of<T> 没转发——用工厂的调用方
拿不到行激活能力，两条构造路径能力不一致。补上形参并转发到主构造函数。

（文档同步：components.md 的 Table/Table.of 两处签名与语义说明。）
---
 docs/components.md    | 7 +++++--
 src/controls/table.cj | 5 +++--
 2 files changed, 8 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/docs/components.md b/docs/components.md
index dfe0251..16659ed 100644
--- a/docs/components.md
+++ b/docs/components.md
@@ -914,15 +914,18 @@ TreeView(roots, selected, initiallyExpanded: ["src", "src/core"])
 
 ```cangjie
 Table(columns: Array<TableColumn>, rows: Array<Array<String>>, selected: Bindable<Int64>,
-    key!: ?String = None)
+    key!: ?String = None, onActivate!: ?(Int64) -> Unit = None)
 ```
 
 - columns：列定义；rows 按列索引的单元格字符串矩阵；selected 选中的原始行索引；key! 可选身份。
+- onActivate!：行激活回调（参数为**原始行索引**，排序后跟随）。**双击行**触发；聚焦后 **Space**
+  触发当前选中行（键盘等价物）。Enter 仍是表头排序切换；未启用激活时 Space 也退回排序。
 
 强类型工厂（以抽取器从行取值，免搭字符串矩阵）：
 
 ```cangjie
-Table.of<T>(data: Array<T>, columns: Array<DataColumn<T>>, selected: Bindable<Int64>, key!: ?String = None)
+Table.of<T>(data: Array<T>, columns: Array<DataColumn<T>>, selected: Bindable<Int64>, key!: ?String = None,
+    onActivate!: ?(Int64) -> Unit = None)
 ```
 
 ### TableColumn
diff --git a/src/controls/table.cj b/src/controls/table.cj
index 3300a14..5dcfdcd 100644
--- a/src/controls/table.cj
+++ b/src/controls/table.cj
@@ -150,7 +150,8 @@ public class Table <: Widget {
         data: Array<T>,
         columns: Array<DataColumn<T>>,
         selected: Bindable<Int64>,
-        key!: ?String = None
+        key!: ?String = None,
+        onActivate!: ?(Int64) -> Unit = None
     ): Table {
         let tableColumns = Array<TableColumn>(columns.size) {
             i => TableColumn(columns[i].title, columns[i].width, numeric: columns[i].numeric, cell: columns[i].cell)
@@ -158,7 +159,7 @@ public class Table <: Widget {
         let rows = Array<Array<String>>(data.size) {
             r => Array<String>(columns.size) {c => columns[c].value(data[r])}
         }
-        Table(tableColumns, rows, selected, key: key)
+        Table(tableColumns, rows, selected, key: key, onActivate: onActivate)
     }
 
     public func measure(_: UiContext, available: Size): Size {
